{title: 535 - I Am Trusting Thee, Lord Jesus}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #535 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 535}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]I am trusting [Eb7]Thee, Lord [Ab]Jesus,
Trusting [Bb]only [Eb]Thee;
[Eb7]Trusting [Ab]Thee for [F]full [Bbm]salvation,
[Eb7]Great and [Ab]free.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab]I am [Eb7]trusting Thee [Ab]for pardon;
[Bb]At Thy [Eb]feet I bow;
[Eb7]For [Ab]Thy grace [F]and [Bbm]tender mercy,
[Eb7]Trusting [Ab]now.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Ab]I am [Eb7]trusting Thee [Ab]to guide me;
[Bb]Thou alone [Eb]shalt lead;
[Eb7]Every [Ab]day [F]and [Bbm]hour supplying
[Eb7]All [Ab]my need.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Ab]I am [Eb7]trusting Thee, [Ab]Lord Jesus;
[Bb]Never let [Eb]me fall;
[Eb7]I [Ab]am [F]trusting [Bbm]Thee forever,
[Eb7]And [Ab]for all.
{end_of_verse}
